    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahanurira inzu ya Yakobo ibyiza n'iby'amahoro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyo Yesaya mwene Amosi yeretswe ku Bayuda no ku b'i Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu minsi y'imperuka umusozi wubatsweho inzu y'Uwiteka uzakomerezwa mu mpinga z'imisozi, ushyirwe hejuru usumbe iyindi kandi amahanga yose azawushikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga menshi azahaguruka avuge ati “Nimuze tuzamuke tujye ku musozi w'Uwiteka, ku nzu y'Imana ya Yakobo kugira ngo ituyobore inzira zayo tuzigenderemo.” Kuko i Siyoni ari ho hazava amategeko, i Yerusalemu hagaturuka ijambo ry'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 4.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Azacira amahanga imanza, azahana amoko menshi. Inkota zabo bazazicuramo amasuka n'amacumu bazayacuramo impabuzo, nta shyanga rizabangurira irindi shyanga inkota, kandi ntabwo bazongera kwiga kurwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa nzu ya Yakobo mwe, nimuze tugendere mu mucyo w'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwoko bwawe ari bwo nzu ya Yakobo, waburekeshejwe n'uko buzuye imigenzo ivuye iburasirazuba, bakaraguza nk'Abafilisitiya kandi bakifatanya n'abanyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihugu cyabo cyuzuye ifeza n'izahabu, ubutunzi bwabo ntibugira uko bungana kandi cyuzuye n'amafarashi, amagare yabo ntagira urugero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihugu cyabo cyuzuye ibishushanyo bisengwa, baramya iby'ubukorikori bw'amaboko yabo, intoki zabo ubwabo ari zo zabiremye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uworoheje yikubita hasi, ukomeye akicisha bugufi, ku bw'ibyo ntubababarire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 6.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 1.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Injira mu isenga wihishe mu mukungugu, uhunge igitinyiro cy'Uwiteka n'ubwiza bw'icyubahiro cye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasuzuguro k'abantu kazacishwa bugufi n'ubwibone bw'abantu buzashyirwa hasi, uwo munsi Uwiteka ni we uzogezwa wenyine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko hazaba umunsi w'Uwiteka Nyiringabo wo gutungura ibyibona n'ibigamika byose n'ikintu cyose cyishyira hejuru, bikazacishwa bugufi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi uzaba no ku myerezi miremire y'i Lebanoni yose yishyira hejuru, no ku myela y'i Bashani yose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku misozi miremire yose no ku misozi yose yishyira hejuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku munara muremure wose no ku nkike yose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no ku nkuge z'i Tarushishi zose no ku bishushanyo binezeza byose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko agasuzuguro k'abantu kazashyirwa hasi n'ubwibone bw'abantu buzacishwa bugufi, uwo munsi Uwiteka ni we uzogezwa wenyine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibigirwamana bizashiraho rwose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bazinjira mu buvumo bwo mu bitare no mu nzobo zo mu butaka, bahunge igitinyiro cy'Uwiteka n'ubwiza bw'icyubahiro cye, ubwo azahagurukana imbaraga aje guhindisha isi umushyitsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi abantu bazajugunya ibishushanyo byabo bisengwa by'ifeza n'iby'izahabu, byacuriwe gusengwa, babijugunyire imbeba n'ubucurama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bajye kwihisha mu buvumo bwo mu bitare no mu bihanamanga, bahunge igitinyiro cy'Uwiteka n'ubwiza bw'icyubahiro cye, ubwo azahagurukana imbaraga aje gutera isi umushyitsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
